Title: Marry Me by Friday
Episode: 2 - Majority Owner
Format: Live-action, cinematic vertical micro drama, 9:16, about 85 seconds
Draft date: 2026-10-19

INT. HALCYON TOWER - CEO OFFICE - DAY

[[HOOK: re-enter on episode 1's peak: Whitlock at the door, Damien's white face.]]

Whitlock in the doorway. Damien stares at him, then laughs.

DAMIEN
She cleans my floors.

WHITLOCK
Not anymore.

Mia peels off her yellow gloves, one finger at a time, and lays them on Damien's desk.

INT. HALCYON TOWER - BOARDROOM - CONTINUOUS

Twelve board members around a long white table turn as Mia walks in, still in her grey uniform. A murmur runs down the table.

On the far wall hangs a painted portrait of the company's two founders, Eleanor Hale and Richard Blake.

Whitlock opens his brass-cornered briefcase and unfolds a will.

WHITLOCK
"To my granddaughter, Mia Calloway, my fifty-one percent of Hale and Blake."

Damien turns from the portrait to Mia.

DAMIEN
Eleanor Hale was your grandmother?

MIA
She still is.

[[PAYOFF: the cleaner takes the head of the table.]]

Mia walks the length of the table to the chair at its head, where Damien's hand rests.

MIA (CONT'D)
You're in my seat, Mr. Blake.

A long beat. Damien lifts his hand and steps aside. Mia sits. The board members glance at each other.

[[TWIST: the inheritance comes with a trap.]]

WHITLOCK
There is one condition.

He slides a page across to Mia.

WHITLOCK (CONT'D)
The founders' pact. The shares pass only to a married heir. Married to a Blake.

MIA
By when?

WHITLOCK
Friday. Midnight.

ON SCREEN: "Friday, midnight. Or the 51% goes to the Blake Family Trust."

Damien leans on the table, enjoying it.

DAMIEN
Then you'd better start dating.

MIA (V.O.)
Grandma. What did you do?

The doors open. VIVIAN BLAKE (58, ivory silk suit, sharp silver bob, jade bangle) walks in. Every board member rises for her. Damien stays where he is, arms folded.

[[CLIFFHANGER - threat: Vivian's ring box and her ultimatum.]]

Vivian sets a black velvet ring box in front of Mia. Her jade bangle taps the table twice.

VIVIAN
(smiling)
My son is a Blake. Marry him by Friday, or my trust takes it all at midnight.

CLOSE ON MIA

Her eyes on the ring box.

CUT TO BLACK.
